Kaam karne ka exact process
Part 1 — Reference audit
- AI_AGENT_ENTRYPOINT.py
- ACRL T07, T14, T16, T23, T24
- state.json
- AI-001 Blueprint
- 360-Degree Gap Closure Structure
Existing code, interfaces, dependencies aur execution authority verify karunga.

Part 2 — Core integration
- Existing ACRL modules ka integration.
- Startup orchestration.
- Incremental context retrieval.
- Fast-resume aur recovery.
Part 3 — EntryPoint + handoff
- Complete EntryPoint integration.
- Verified context generation.
- Previous progress aur current task reconstruction.
- New-chat handoff mechanism.
Part 4 — Testing + evidence
- Full integration tests.
- Stale cache and SHA validation.
- Recovery tests.
- Startup performance measurements.
- GitHub Actions evidence.
Coding delivery ka format
- Har part mein complete file contents.
- Exact repository paths.
- Existing files ke replacement ya modification ki clear identification.
- Duplicate files nahi.
- Half code ya incomplete placeholders nahi.
- Completion ka claim tabhi jab actual implementation aur verification evidence ho.
Ek important condition: Main AI-001 ko dobara implement nahi karunga. Approved blueprint aur existing ACRL architecture ko follow karunga.

Meri preference hai ki pehle current GitHub HEAD aur canonical state.json dobara verify karun. Uske baad hi coding dunga, taaki galat task par implementation shuru na ho.

Tumhe reference files manually collect karke dene ki zaroorat nahi, agar repository access se woh available hain.
